    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin adds a email return-path and envelope-from address to the wp_mail () function. Which reduces the spam score sent from your website form.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Either using the dashboard &#8216;Add Plugin&#8217; feature to find, install and activate the plugin,  or<br />\n1. Download and unzip the plugin<br />\n2. Upload the entire contents of improve-email-spam-score to the /wp-contents/plugins directory.<br />\n3. Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First Release</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor changes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<p>Fixed PHP error</p>\n<h4>1.3</h4>\n<p>Added fallback if no e-mail set in plugin settings.</p>\n"
    },
